            </note>
            <note corresp="#d335-f3" n="3" xml:id="d335-f3-content">
                <p>The summary, the memorandum, and an annex to the summary giving more details were
                    attached to Read’s August 10 memorandum.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
